            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An information processing apparatus includes acquisition means for acquiring, based on an event notification from an operating system of the information processing apparatus, capability information of a printer, the event notification being issued based on a selection of a print queue of the printer; and display means for displaying an object for accepting a setting based on the acquired capability information, the capability information including predetermined information on a predetermined setting which is not settable in a case where a print setting application is not installed.</p>
